      "writtenOn": "2014-06-08T16:16:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand how you are verifying how the context manager properly cleans up after itself, but what is the action that  automatically causes the context manager to clean up after itself?",
      "revId": "73f916900bc13d72f9184a6ec9cf5125ad3df874",
